Load.pdf','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for applying. Unfortunately, your Saturday morning availability conflicted with mandatory varsity traveling schedules. We encourage you to re-apply next semester.','2026-09-05 15:00:00','2026-09-10 14:00:00'),(22,20,14,'I am applying for the Technical Customer Care internship. I have solid troubleshooting logic and articulate communication skills.','[\"Sat - Whole Day (8AM\\u20135PM)\"]','Ethan_Vance_Reyes_Resume.pdf','Juan_Dela_Cruz_StudyLoad.pdf','accepted','2026-09-18','04:30 PM','Robinsons Dasma Tech Wing, 3rd Floor','Passed English proficiency evaluation (CEFR B2+). Assigned to weekend technical support team.','2026-09-13 10:30:00','2026-09-20 16:00:00');
